    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**电流强度是一个物理量.** 要测定它就必须先规定出测量",
        "单位——电流强度的单位."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "可以利用电流的任一种效应来规定电流强度的单位."
      ]
    },
